{c: Chords: the writer's own chart}

{start_of_verse: Verse}
[C2]Father of [D]lights, [Gmaj7]Ancient of [Em]days,
We [C2]long to be [D]here in Your [D/G]pres[G]ence
[C2]Your perfect [D]love, [Gmaj7]casting out [Em]fear,
[C2]Keeping us [D]close to Your [G]heart
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[G]Worthy are You, [D]Lord, we [Am]give You all our [Em]praises
[Am]We welcome all the [Em]changes You’ve [D]made within our hearts
Old [G]man is slowly [D]dying, a [Am]new man is [Em]rising
[C/A]Do a new [D]work in our [A]hearts
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_bridge}
[F#m]Father of [D]wisdom, [A]Father of [E]life
[F#m]Father of [D]mercy, [E]Father of love, [A]Father of light
[F#m]Father of [D]wisdom, [A]Father of [E]life
[F#m]Father of [D]mercy, [E]Father of love, [A]Father of light, [E]Father of love
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus 2}
[A]Worthy are You, [E]Lord, we [Bm]give You all our [F#m]praises
We [Bm]welcome all the [F#m]changes You’ve [E]made within our [Esus4]hearts [E]
Old [A]man is slowly [E]dying, a [Bm]new man is [F#m]rising
[D]Do a new [E]work in our [A]hearts
[D]Do a new [E]work in our [A]hearts
[D]Do a new [E]work in our [A]hearts
{end_of_chorus}
